WEBVTT

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:38.430
The capital...

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:39.600
...to Kazalm.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:43.260
On the way there it's uphill, so we can't do much about that,

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:46.530
but on the way back, shouldn't we stay at Sir Kazalm's place,

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:49.270
then go down the river?

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:51.280
Yes, that's a good idea.

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:55.590
The Kazalm River is wide and has a gentle flow.

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:57.970
We don't have to worry about capsizing, either.

00:01:57.970 --> 00:02:04.520
Considering the Queen's physical condition, a ship would be much easier for her.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:16.490
When the palace heard about Lilan having her baby, the Queen decided to visit Kazalm and see the baby herself.

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:24.500
The Queen, Harumiya

00:02:53.860 --> 00:03:03.280
A great number of people gathered along the road to catch a glimpse of the Queen as she headed to the Kazalm Beast-Lord Care Center.

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:09.230
The Queen gazed upon the people with eyes like those of a child.

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:18.550
Damiya.  The sky, the mountain, the flowers, and the trees.

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:22.710
The people, along with everything else, are shining like jewelry.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:28.480
You're governing this entire beautiful country, Your Majesty.

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:39.380
You mean they left the palace?

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:40.100
Yes.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:48.480
Despite this being such a critical time with the Queen leaving the palace for the first time,

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:51.920
they left without saying a word to us?

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:53.690
Father!

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:55.210
You mustn't strain yourself!

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:58.400
I'm fine, Shunan.

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:08.890
Everyone, please be careful that Her Majesty does not see Erin.

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:11.780
Do you all understand?

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:12.310
Yes.

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:14.270
Erin.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:15.500
Yes.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:18.320
No matter what happens, you must not come out.

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:19.990
Do you understand?

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:22.010
Yes.

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:25.610
Listen up, everyone.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:30.960
These were made specifically for the Queen's visit.

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:34.190
Be careful not to rip them.

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:35.810
Okay.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.450
That's mine!

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:41.340
Who stepped on my clothes?

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:43.430
Hey, keep it down!

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:56.690
We've been expecting you.

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:58.810
I'm Ial, the Captain of Security.

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:01.990
The Queen will be arriving shortly.

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:09.130
It's bigger than expected.

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:12.930
We wouldn't be able to tell if there's something hidden there.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:17.060
Here are the faces of those related to Kazalm.

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:19.250
You'll be able to recognize anyone suspicious if they're not on those.

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:25.820
Great work.

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:27.180
How may I help you?

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:30.250
My name is Kiriku, one of the teachers here.

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:34.230
I was told to escort the Captain around.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:39.250
Thank you for the offer, but I'd like to see things for myself.

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:47.680
Erin.

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:49.250
What's wrong?

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:51.390
Never mind.  It's nothing.

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:55.290
Ial-san.

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:14.890
Welcome.  Welcome to Kazalm.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:22.880
Our great, holy Queen.

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:38.810
The beast-lords will spread their wings and welcome you, too.

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:46.780
We will hold hands, form a circle, and welcome the Queen,
who is our light.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:07:00.770
Welcome.  Welcome to Kazalm.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:06.250
Our great, holy Queen.

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:07.670
Thank you.
Our great, holy Queen.

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:08.760
Our great, holy Queen.

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:16.600
We will hold hands, form a circle, and welcome the Queen,
who is our light.

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:35.970
Thank you so much for visiting the Kazalm Beast-Lord Care Center and the academy.

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:40.490
I am the Reverend of the Teachers here at Kazalm Academy, Esal.

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:48.390
Esal, could we skip the formalities and take me to the beast-lords?

00:07:48.390 --> 00:07:51.530
I've been looking forward to it very much as I came here.

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:54.120
Most certainly.

00:07:56.480 --> 00:07:58.020
Oh, my!

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:01.500
They look like they're enjoying the dip.

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:08.460
On a day like this, I'm sure it's warm lying on top of the grass, too.

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:13.510
Please look over there.

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:16.030
That's Lilan and Eku.

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:20.930
And Owl, the child you named.

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:28.000
Oh, you're right.  There's a baby.

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:31.080
How adorable.

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:32.740
It's pretty far.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:35.050
We can't see well from here.

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:37.970
Why didn't you keep them inside the shed?

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:46.340
If we keep them locked in on a nice day like this, they start a tantrum because they want to go out.

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:51.240
There are times when they hurt themselves slamming against the walls, so we let them outside.

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:52.890
I see.

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:55.950
But as Ouri said, it is a little far.

00:08:56.420 --> 00:09:01.360
I've come this far, so can I possibly get a little closer?

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:11.210
If I may speak, with all due respect.

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:15.390
As you are aware, beast-lords do not befriend humans.

00:09:15.390 --> 00:09:18.100
It's dangerous to go any closer.

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:23.350
Just blow the mute whistle if necessary.

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:25.760
But Owl's still a newborn.

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:28.590
The mute whistle would be too much stress for its body.

00:09:28.590 --> 00:09:30.840
Why not just a little closer?

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:34.290
We'll be careful, too.

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:40.010
As you wish.

00:09:57.190 --> 00:09:58.980
Please enter through here.

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:04.660
Little girl, you can't stand out!

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:06.250
You can't go!

00:10:06.490 --> 00:10:07.550
But!

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:21.610
Erin-chan!
Little girl!

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:25.810
My goodness, how adorable!

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:28.770
And they're so beautiful.

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:28.790
It's my first time seeing such beautiful beast-lords.
And they're so beautiful.

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:32.480
It's my first time seeing such beautiful beast-lords.

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:37.980
The big one is Eku, and the smaller one's Lilan, am I right?

00:10:40.590 --> 00:10:44.670
Your Majesty, please don't go any closer.

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:47.030
Wouldn't a little closer be fine?

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:51.200
Why would a beast-lord that was given to the Queen ever harm her?

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:57.150
It's dangerous!

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:58.670
Please stop them!

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:01.160
They'll be alarmed if she goes any closer.

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:12.730
The mute whistle!

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:19.310
Don't blow it!

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:23.110
Blow!  What are you all doing?!

00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:25.010
Blow the mute whistle already!

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:53.960
It's fine.  There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:56.520
Calm down, Lilan.

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:03.130
What is that girl doing?

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:05.690
She's calming the beast-lord down.

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:08.660
"Calming the beast-lord down?"

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:10.520
With the tune of a harp?

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:16.340
Thank you, Lilan.

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:23.090
Please step back, Your Majesty.

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:26.220
Those beast-lords are currently raising a child.

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:28.650
Please understand that.

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:31.370
You're right.  I understand.

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:42.920
I can't believe this.  Calming a beast-lord with a harp?

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:45.280
She's been exposed!

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:47.390
Will the little girl be all right?

00:12:56.290 --> 00:13:00.530
It's my first time seeing a beast-lord being calmed by using a harp.

00:13:00.740 --> 00:13:03.490
Is it often done at the Care Centers?

00:13:03.490 --> 00:13:06.020
No, that's not the case.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:08.100
Lilan grew up with it,

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:16.650
so I think she calms down when she hears the tune from her harp.

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:30.140
I would love to hear the story directly from her.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:37.810
I'm very sorry, but she's feverish right now.

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:42.730
I have told her strictly to not present herself before Your Highness.

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:47.230
I see.  That's a shame.

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:52.260
Pardon me.  The alcohol seems to be moving around in me pretty well.

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:56.030
I should feel better if I feel a chill from the wind outside.

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:58.460
Then allow me to take you around.

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:21.620
What should I do, Lilan?

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:27.940
I've done something terrible.

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:31.540
What a surprise.

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:38.030
I never thought there'd be a girl who could control a beast-lord without using the mute whistle.

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:40.980
No, I'm...

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.760
I'm sure you know,

00:14:43.760 --> 00:14:49.430
but the Beast-Lord Imperatives are an important code to be followed while taking care of the Queen's precious beast-lords.

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:53.450
What you're doing is a violation of that.

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:57.270
It's a crime.

00:15:01.190 --> 00:15:04.880
The beast-lords go back into their sheds at night, right?

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:11.580
Yes.  It's almost their mealtime, so they should be back in their sheds.

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:16.350
Then I'd like to see that family once more before I return.

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:21.340
Will I be able to see them eating?

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:25.160
Is there a problem?

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:26.440
No.

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:28.050
It would be our honor.

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:33.440
So there's someone who doesn't obey the Beast-Lord Imperatives.

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:40.830
I won't be worrying about it too much, but there are those who are picky at the capital.

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:44.820
I wonder what they would say if they found this out?

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:53.620
Are you an Arryo?

00:15:55.090 --> 00:16:00.600
Now that I think about it, I met a woman of the Mist People at a village of Touda breeders before.

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:07.510
I see.  You have beautiful eyes.

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:11.680
This is my first time seeing green eyes this closely.

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:16.470
Green eyes that seem as though they hide every secret.

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:20.190
I can understand why they're thought to be people who wield magic.

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:29.720
Interesting.

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:32.140
I'll protect you.

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:38.720
Don't get all stiff like that.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:45.460
I only want you to transfer to Lazal along with these beast-lords.

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:50.220
Don't worry, Lilan.  It's all right.

00:16:50.740 --> 00:16:54.930
I apologize, but could you let go of my hand?

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:58.560
You're a very calm girl.

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:01.680
You make me lose some of my confidence.

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:06.190
I always thought I was a little more attractive.

00:17:06.190 --> 00:17:08.390
That's far enough, Damiya.

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:16.570
You must have been listening.

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:19.480
That was an embarrassing moment to be caught.

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:20.870
Since when were you listening?

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:26.850
For long enough that I could tell that you were going to be rejected after your long-winded smooth talk.

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:35.960
It seems Damiya has caused you trouble.

00:17:36.350 --> 00:17:41.790
He has a habit of talking to all women he sees with charm.

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:44.260
Please forgive him.

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:46.860
Absolutely.

00:17:47.150 --> 00:17:49.590
I was very rude myself.

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:52.820
Lift your head.

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:59.240
I admire your strength for not giving in to my nephew.

00:18:04.370 --> 00:18:05.420
Hey!

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:08.840
I'm very sorry.  It's begging for food.

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:14.090
I'm very sorry.  It seems as though I got in the way of their dinner.

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:22.790
No mute whistle here, either?

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:29.250
Erin took care of Lilan every moment of the day at a time when Lilan was nearly dead, saving her.

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:32.810
That must be why she's especially attached to Erin.

00:18:44.570 --> 00:18:46.120
You eat up, too, Lilan.

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:54.470
That was wonderful.

00:18:54.470 --> 00:19:01.840
I'm not trying to be like Damiya, but I'd be happy to have you and those beast-lords at Lazal.

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:07.940
You can calm beast-lords without using the mute whistle, right?

00:19:08.520 --> 00:19:11.770
I actually don't like that whistle, either.

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:18.140
Your Majesty!  How could you be one to say such a thing?!

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:19.570
What's the problem?

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:25.490
If beast-lords can be raised without using those whistles, then I'd like everyone to.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:33.610
The babies at Lazal may have lots of babies themselves if they're brought up without the mute whistle.

00:19:33.880 --> 00:19:39.420
Wouldn't it be lovely if the fields were filled with baby beast-lords?

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:49.270
The revelation that the Queen didn't like the mute whistle was truly unexpected.

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:57.400
It was the Queen's ancestor, Je, who wrote in the <i>Beast-Lord Imperatives</i> to use the mute whistle when raising beast-lords,

00:19:57.400 --> 00:20:03.260
therefore the Queen should know the reason why the Beast-Lord Imperatives were created.

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:08.480
What's the matter?  You don't want to leave here?

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:13.220
This is my home.

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:18.210
Also, Owl is so young that I don't want to put it through a long trip.

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:19.790
I see.

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:26.180
Then I'll ask again once Owl is big enough for long trips.

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:29.380
Of course.  It would be a great honor.

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:39.950
As such, the Queen completed her visit to the Kazalm Beast-Lord Care Center,

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:43.830
and made her way to Sir Kazalm's estate, her resting place for the night.

00:20:46.650 --> 00:20:49.270
Good evening, Your Majesty.

00:20:49.270 --> 00:20:52.520
Welcome!

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:01.190
I told you strictly to not show up.

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:03.340
I'm very sorry.

00:21:03.760 --> 00:21:10.620
But I was worried that the mute whistle might cause stress to Owl.

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:16.630
About the mute whistle, why did the Queen say she didn't like it?

00:21:18.430 --> 00:21:19.520
I'm not sure.

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:25.090
Maybe the Queen has different thoughts than those from the <i>Beast-Lord Imperatives</i>.

00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:32.270
Or did she know everything and was simply testing us?

00:21:33.030 --> 00:21:36.790
She didn't appear like she knew about it to me.

00:21:37.970 --> 00:21:39.920
I agree with you.

00:21:44.290 --> 00:21:50.100
Perhaps the Queen doesn't know the secret behind the Beast-Lord Imperatives?

00:22:06.860 --> 00:22:14.120
Erin was feeling an indescribable anxiety due to the Queen's words.

00:22:14.950 --> 00:22:22.130
A feeling similar to being surrounded by a thick fog nestled into Erin's heart.

00:24:01.900 --> 00:24:08.260
As the Queen finishes her trip, the ship with her onboard sails down the river.

00:24:08.260 --> 00:24:11.380
The teachers and the students all gather at the top of the hill to get a glimpse of her.

00:24:11.380 --> 00:24:13.160
That's when it all begins.

00:24:13.160 --> 00:24:17.170
Erin flies in the sky on Lilan's back and dives into the swarm of Touda.

00:24:17.500 --> 00:24:21.810
What will she think, seeing her soar in the sky like that?

00:24:22.070 --> 00:24:25.050
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Attack of the Touda.

00:24:25.050 --> 00:26:00.070
Attack of the Touda
